{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"直化"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"直化"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>将范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维范畴","text":"纤维范畴"}},{"Plain":"对应到函子 $\\mathcal C \\to \\mathsf{Cat}$, 称为<strong>直化</strong> (straightening); 反之称为<strong>反直化</strong> (unstraightening). (反) 直化也称为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Grothendieck构造","text":"Grothendieck 构造"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>设 $\\mathcal C$ 为范畴, 记 $\\mathsf{CartFib}(\\mathcal C)$ 为其上"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维范畴","text":"拉回纤维化"}},{"Plain":"的 $2$-范畴, 则\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{CartFib}(\\mathcal C) \\overset{\\simeq}{\\to} \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Cat}).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}